1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He left Sweden "at the age of 16, he sailed the Atlantic for 8 years and made 2 complete trips around the world. In, 1872, he came to Milwaukee and for 22 yrs., was first mate on sailing vessels of the Great Lakes.
